Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Align level labels, add stronger disclaimer, and
 per-question breakdown on Dashboard

- Result.jsx: absolute-score fallback labels now match the z-score labels
  exactly (Perlu Perhatian/Mulai Berkembang/Cukup Siap/Siap/Sangat Siap)
  instead of a differently-worded set, so the vocabulary is consistent
  regardless of which mode is active.
- Result.jsx: added an explicit disclaimer box -- not medical, financial,
  or psychological professional advice; a subjective self-assessment only,
  not a sole reference for important decisions.
- Dashboard.jsx: each domain card now has a 'Lihat rincian per pertanyaan'
  toggle showing the population average for every individual question in
  that domain (not just the domain-level aggregate) -- facilitator-only,
  still no participant names. Added the same disclaimer at the bottom.
- store.js: syncCheckinResult now also writes raw per-item answers into
  a new 'answers' jsonb column so the dashboard can compute per-question
  averages without needing broader access to individual journey_state rows.
- Supabase migration: added answers jsonb column to mapan_checkin_results.
